    "Free Folder Hider Backup File",
    "3.0",
    "Presentation template created by Presentations, a slide show creation program included in the SoftMaker Office suite; can be used as a template for creating Presentations slide shows (.PRD files); similar to a Microsoft PowerPoint.POTX file and can be saved to the POTX format in Presentations. Windows SoftMaker Office. Linux SoftMaker Office. Image preview created by E-on Vue, a program used for 3D environment modeling; contains a preview image of a 3D scene, which typically has a lower resolution than the final rendered scene; used for storing scene previews before final production. Windows E-on Vue. Mac E-on Vue. Backup file created by. Folder Hider, a program used for hiding Windows folders; contains the data of the folders the user has chosen to hide, as well as password protection information; used for restoring the hidden folders in the event they are lost in some way.. Folder Hider is useful for protecting sensitive personal information on computers that are shared by multiple users. Windows AutoBAUP. Folder HiderFree.",
