    "Free Hide Folder Backup File",
    "3.0",
    "Backup file created by. Hide Folder, a program used for hiding folders in Windows; saves a backup listing of all folders the user has chosen to hide; can be used to restore all folders that have been hidden after opened. NOTE: The folders hidden using. Hide Folder cannot be found by anyone else. Therefore, when using. Hide Folder, it is important to make backups (FHF files) and store them in a safe location. Windows Cleanersoft. Hide FolderFree.",
