    ".TMR",
    "Free Countdown Timer Backup File",
    "3.0",
    "File created by. Countdown Timer, a program used for setting countdowns for birthdays, anniversaries, the new year, and other events; saves a backup of the countdown list and can be used for restoring countdowns or sharing countdowns with other. Countdown Timer users. You can load a TMR file by choosing File → Load from File from the application menu. To save a TMR file, choose File → Save to File. NOTE: TMR files use a simple text format to store the countdown information. Windows Comfort Software Group. Countdown TimerFree. File created by Timer, a stopwatch and clock utility for Mac OS X; contains saved timer settings for the stopwatch, countdown, alarm clock, and standard clock features; used for saving and reusing the settings created in the program. Mac Apimac Timer.",
